# Empty on purpose, and present on purpose.
#
# Empty: the Go side's gate is "whatever the standard tool does with no
# options" (see the Makefile's fmt target), and the frontend's is the
# same bargain -- prettier's defaults, no house style to remember, no
# number in here that we then own forever. Present: without a config
# file prettier walks up out of the repository looking for one, so a
# contributor with a ~/.prettierrc would format this tree to their own
# settings and redden CI. This file is what stops that.
{}
